  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Database Check",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [],
        "url": {
          "raw": "localhost:8000/db-check",
          "host": [
            "localhost"
          ],
          "port": "8000",
          "path": [
            "db-check"
          ]
        },
        "description": "## Database Health Check\n\nVerifies that the application server can successfully connect to the database and retrieves a basic summary of the current data state.\n\n---\n\n### Method & Endpoint\n\n```\nGET localhost:8000/db-check\n\n ```\n\n---\n\n### Response\n\n**Example Response Body:**\n\n``` json\n{\n  \"status\": \"connected\",\n  \"product_count\": 0\n}\n\n ```\n\n| Field | Type | Description |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| `status` | `string` | Indicates the current state of the database connection. A value of `\"connected\"` confirms the database is reachable and operational. |\n| `product_count` | `number` | The total number of product records currently stored in the database. Useful for a quick sanity check on data availability. |"
      },
      "response": []
    },
    {
      "name": "View Products",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [],
        "url": {
          "raw": "localhost:8000/products",
          "host": [
            "localhost"
          ],
          "port": "8000",
          "path": [
            "products"
          ],
          "query": [
            {
              "key": "name",
              "value": "fertilizer",
              "disabled": true
            },
            {
              "key": "unit",
              "value": "each",
              "disabled": true
            },
            {
              "key": "name",
              "value": "basil",
              "type": "text",
              "disabled": true
            }
          ]
        },
        "description": "Retrieves a list of all products in the inventory. Each product includes the following fields:\n\n- **name** – The product name (e.g., `Basil Plant - 4in Pot`)\n- **unit** – The unit of measurement (e.g., `each`)\n- **cost_per_unit** – The cost price per unit (e.g., `1.75`)\n- **price_per_unit** – The retail price per unit (e.g., `4.99`)\n- **quantity_in_stock** – The current stock quantity (e.g., `40`)\n\n**Method:** GET  \n**URL:** `localhost:8000/products`  \n**Response:** Returns a JSON array of product objects."
      },
      "response": []
    },
    {
      "name": "Create Product",
      "request": {
        "auth": {
          "type": "bearer",
