              "value": "eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJzdWIiOiIxIiwiZXhwIjoxNzg1MzU3ODMwfQ.JWf1UpVkbFu3kcZOaIZkvoeEFGQgRwL963e5nuzQBD4",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\r\n    \"name\": \"Basil Plant - 4in Pot\",\r\n    \"unit\": \"each\",\r\n    \"cost_per_unit\": \"1.75\",\r\n    \"price_per_unit\": \"4.99\",\r\n    \"quantity_in_stock\": \"40\"\r\n}",
          "options": {
            "raw": {
              "language": "json"
            }
          }
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "localhost:8000/products",
          "host": [
            "localhost"
          ],
          "port": "8000",
          "path": [
            "products"
          ]
        },
        "description": "Creates a new product in the inventory.\n\n**Endpoint:** `POST localhost:8000/products`\n\n### Request Body\n\nSend a JSON object with the following fields:\n\n| Field | Type | Description |\n|---|---|---|\n| `name` | string | The display name of the product (e.g. `\"Basil Plant - 4in Pot\"`) |\n| `unit` | string | The unit of measure for the product (e.g. `\"each\"`, `\"lb\"`, `\"oz\"`) |\n| `cost_per_unit` | string | The cost to the business per unit (e.g. `\"1.75\"`) |\n| `price_per_unit` | string | The retail price charged per unit (e.g. `\"4.99\"`) |\n| `quantity_in_stock` | string | The current number of units available in stock (e.g. `\"40\"`) |\n\n### Example Request Body\n\n```json\n{\n    \"name\": \"Basil Plant - 4in Pot\",\n    \"unit\": \"each\",\n    \"cost_per_unit\": \"1.75\",\n    \"price_per_unit\": \"4.99\",\n    \"quantity_in_stock\": \"40\"\n}\n```\n\n### Responses\n\n- **201 Created** – Product was successfully created. Returns the new product object.\n- **400 Bad Request** – Required fields are missing or invalid."
      },
      "response": []
    },
